speechtext:
Mr. O'NEILL moved:
For a copy of all correspondence, telegrams and reports relative to the construction, financing or operation of the Rouyn railway passing between the government or any department or official thereof and:
1. The management of the Canadian National Railways or any officer or official thereof;
2.	The government of the province of Quebec or any department or official thereof;
3.	The Rouyn Railway Company or any officer or official thereof;
4.	Messrs. Dillon, Read and Company or any official thereof;
5.	The American Exchange Securities Corporation or any official thereof;
6.	The Noranda Mines Limited, or any official thereof.
Hon. CHARLES A. DUNNING (Minister of Railways and Canals):	Stand.
fMr. C. A. Stewart.]
